00:13:34,493 --> 00:13:39,698
Gue saring dulu, tenangin diri.
Baru gue cerita ke seseorang.

213
00:13:39,733 --> 00:13:40,733
Omongin ya? Betul.

214
00:13:42,443 --> 00:13:43,303
Kalau dari Cero?

215
00:13:43,543 --> 00:13:44,383
Ya, Cero sih.

216
00:13:45,343 --> 00:13:46,083
Masa lu

217
00:13:53,383 --> 00:13:55,308
Bukan gak pernah sih jarang banget cerita.

218
00:13:55,343 --> 00:13:59,943
Iya kan? Iya karena, menurut gue tuh
gue lebih suka mending semuanya sendiri,

219
00:14:00,183 --> 00:14:02,463
Nanti kalau emang misalkan
udah bener-bener cap.

220
00:14:02,593 --> 00:14:09,153
Ada teman baik gue dari SMA.
Gue bisa cerita ke dia.
